ics-2-p003-n0008"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0004","text":"是全面建设社会主义现代化国家的首要任务，是我国经济社会发展的主题","bbox":[692.049,68.023,440.834,13.776],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0009"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0005","text":"是能够很好满足人民日益增长的美好生活需要的发展","bbox":[692.049,107.629,316.85,13.776],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0010"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0006","text":"是体现新发展理念的发展，是创新成为第一动力、协调成为内生特点、绿色成为普遍形态、开放成为必由之路、共享成为根本目的的发展","bbox":[692.049,147.236,427.059,34.44],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0011","politics-2-p003-n0012"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0007","text":"高质量发展，就是从“有没有”转向“好不好”","bbox":[692.049,202.349,257.679,18.933],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0013","politics-2-p003-n0014","politics-2-p003-n0015","politics-2-p003-n0016","politics-2-p003-n0017","politics-2-p003-n0018","politics-2-p003-n0019","politics-2-p003-n0020"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0008","text":"一、进入新发展阶段","bbox":[535.346,316.853,123.985,13.776],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0021"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0009","text":"1.新发展阶段是全面建成小康社会、实现第一个百年奋斗目标之后，全面建设社会主义现代化国家、向第二个百年奋斗目标进军的重要阶段","bbox":[692.049,251.493,427.059,39.53],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0022","politics-2-p003-n0023","politics-2-p003-n0024"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0010","text":"2.新发展阶段是我们迎来从站起来、富起来到强起来历史性跨越的新阶段","bbox":[692.049,311.763,437.189,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0025","politics-2-p003-n0026","politics-2-p003-n0027","politics-2-p003-n0028"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0011","text":"3.新发展阶段是我国社会主义初级阶段历史进程中的一个重要阶段","bbox":[692.049,351.37,395.389,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0029","politics-2-p003-n0030","politics-2-p003-n0031"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0012","text":"二、贯彻新发展理念","bbox":[535.346,475.278,123.985,13.776],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0032"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0013","text":"1.创新是引领发展的第一动力——解决发展动力问题","bbox":[692.049,390.976,306.329,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0033","politics-2-p003-n0034","politics-2-p003-n0035","politics-2-p003-n0036","politics-2-p003-n0037","politics-2-p003-n0038","politics-2-p003-n0039","politics-2-p003-n0040"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0014","text":"2.协调是持续健康发展的内在要求——解决发展不平衡问题","bbox":[692.049,430.582,350.093,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0041","politics-2-p003-n0042","politics-2-p003-n0043","politics-2-p003-n0044","politics-2-p003-n0045","politics-2-p003-n0046","politics-2-p003-n0047","politics-2-p003-n0048"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0015","text":"3.绿色是永续发展的必要条件——解决人与自然和谐共生问题","bbox":[692.049,470.188,363.398,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0049","politics-2-p003-n0050","politics-2-p003-n0051","politics-2-p003-n0052","politics-2-p003-n0053","politics-2-p003-n0054","politics-2-p003-n0055","politics-2-p003-n0056"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0016","text":"4.开放是国家繁荣发展的必由之路——解决发展内外联动问题","bbox":[692.049,509.794,364.286,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0057","politics-2-p003-n0058","politics-2-p003-n0059","politics-2-p003-n0060","politics-2-p003-n0061","politics-2-p003-n0062","politics-2-p003-n0063","politics-2-p003-n0064"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0017","text":"5.共享是中国特色社会主义的本质要求——解决社会公平正义问题","bbox":[692.049,549.4,390.909,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0065","politics-2-p003-n0066","politics-2-p003-n0067","politics-2-p003-n0068","politics-2-p003-n0069","politics-2-p003-n0070","politics-2-p003-n0071","politics-2-p003-n0072"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0018","text":"三、构建新发展格局","bbox":[535.346,693.973,123.985,13.776],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0073"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0019","text":"1.构建以国内大循环为主体、国内国际双循环相互促进的新发展格局","bbox":[692.049,589.007,407.201,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0074","politics-2-p003-n0075","politics-2-p003-n0076","politics-2-p003-n0077"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0020","text":"2.是把握发展主动权的先手棋，不是被迫之举和权宜之计","bbox":[692.049,628.613,340.756,18.866],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p003-n0078","politics-2-p003-n0079","politics-2-p003-n0080","politics-2-p003-n0081","politics-2-p003-n0082","politics-2-p003-n0083"]},{"id":"politics-2-p003-b0021","text":"3.要以全国统一大市场为基础，不是各地都搞自我小循环。","bbox":[692.049,668.219,354.062,18.866],"nodeIds":["polit